coi rodo

i continued work on my parser.
it is capable to understand stuff like pa re ci, pareci or p a r e c i.
it also understands nononononononononononopa as 1.
it also understands papapa fi'u papapa as 1 (111/111 =3D=3D 1)
it can also do the pi thing (pa pi pa =3D 1.1)
it understands pa ki'o as 1000 and pa ki'o pa as 1001 and some other
combinations.

it also accepts "normal" numbers, but that is quite lame ;)

if you manage to break it by telling it a correct lojban number but it
doesn't understand it please tell me on irc or per mail.

however: ra'e doesnt work yet (pa pi ra'e ci for 1.33333[...])
